                <pb facs="0428" n="314" sameAs="frus:frus1924v01/pg314"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">875.00/164: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Albania</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Grant-Smith</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tirana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1924-12-12T14:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 12,
                                1924—2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 7:55 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>91. Threats of incursion by refugees from Yugoslav territory increase as the date
                    for the election approaches. Reports in the foreign press that a revolution has
                    started in Albania are premature.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grant-Smith</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
